# Paths under /srv/zaxon that this repo does NOT own and must never be
# deleted by a deploy. data/ is always kept; these are the extras.
#
# uv/ is the uv-managed CPython 3.11 the venv symlinks to, lifted off the old
# hermes distro (97M). It is runtime, not state -- the right home for it is the
# image, and upstream hermes-agent ships its own Dockerfile that would do that.
# Until that switch, it lives here and must survive every deploy.
uv
